            "value": "所有設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow the microphone and speech recognition for Evening Reader in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在「設定」中允許 Evening Reader 使用麥克風與語音辨識。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amber": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "琥珀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An .acsm file is a note telling Adobe's software which book to fetch and lock to your account. There is no book inside it to read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".acsm 檔只是一張便條，告訴 Adobe 的軟體要下載哪本書並鎖定到你的帳號。檔案裡沒有可閱讀的書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answered on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這部裝置上回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App by Jon Bobrow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jon Bobrow 製作的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence declined to answer that one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 拒絕回答這個問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is still downloading its model. Try again in a little while.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 仍在下載模型，請稍後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is turned off. Turn it on in Settings to ask about a passage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 已關閉。請在「設定」中開啟，才能詢問段落相關問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence isn't available right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 目前無法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence isn't ready yet on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 在這部裝置上尚未準備就緒。"
