            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聽寫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation isn’t available right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聽寫目前無法使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display settings come up short over the page you're reading, so a change is seen on the real thing. Pull up for everything, now in two tabs, Light and Type.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示設定會以精簡版面浮在你正在閱讀的頁面上，任何調整都能直接在內文上看見。向上拉即可看到全部設定，現在分為「光線」與「排版」兩個標籤頁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each article is a Markdown note with its pictures and highlights beside it, so the library opens as an Obsidian vault.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每篇文章都是一則 Markdown 筆記，圖片與重點就放在旁邊，因此整個書庫可以直接當作 Obsidian 資料庫開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編輯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit site": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編輯網站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evening Reader keeps the articles you come across during the day, stripped down to the words and lit warm for reading after dark.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Evening Reader 會保存你白天遇到的文章，只留下文字，並以溫暖的光呈現，讓你在入夜後閱讀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exit full screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "結束全螢幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explain this simply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簡單解釋這段內容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetching from iCloud…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在從 iCloud 取得…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往該處"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "劃重點"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重點"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a key for its accents, and tap the mic to speak instead of type.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住按鍵可輸入重音字母；點一下麥克風即可用說的代替打字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How a page gets here from Safari or any other app, how to set the glow, and how to keep a passage. Shown to new readers, and any time from About.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "說明如何從 Safari 或其他 App 把頁面存到這裡、如何調整光色，以及如何保留段落。新讀者會自動看到，之後也可隨時從「關於」開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it works": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圖像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Safari — or any app with a link in it — tap the Share button on the page you want to keep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Safari（或任何含有連結的 App）中，點一下你想保留的頁面上的「分享」按鈕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the browser, the bar stays put on anything that isn't an article, and a site you keep as an app gets a single row with its name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在瀏覽器中，非文章頁面的工具列會固定不動；當作 App 保留的網站只會顯示一列名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the panel's ink, like a page is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以面板的墨色呈現，就像頁面一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your library": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的書庫中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's waiting here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它就在這裡等你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its first letter until one is found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找到圖像前，先顯示名稱的第一個字。"
          }
        }
