            "value": "書庫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library loans and most store purchases carry Adobe or LCP protection, which only their own app can open — Libby keeps its loans inside Libby. Evening Reader reads books that aren't locked: Standard Ebooks, Project Gutenberg, and DRM-free purchases from the stores that offer them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圖書館借閱與大部分商店購買的書籍都帶有 Adobe 或 LCP 保護，只能用它們自己的 App 開啟，例如 Libby 的借閱書只能在 Libby 中閱讀。Evening Reader 可以閱讀未上鎖的書：Standard Ebooks、Project Gutenberg，以及提供無 DRM 版本的商店所購買的書籍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
