    "Save articles, books and PDFs, then read them on a single warm glow you set yourself. Offline, in your own iCloud folders, for the last hour of the day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存文章、書籍與 PDF，在你親手調整的溫暖光色下閱讀。離線可讀，存放在你自己的 iCloud 資料夾裡，陪你度過一天的最後一小時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
