    "Tap Share": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下「分享」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap into an empty field and Paste is offered right there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下空白欄位，「貼上」就會出現在那裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the sun to make the glow warmer or cooler, brighter or dimmer, or to turn the page to night. Keep a glow you like and switch back to it in a tap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點一下太陽，即可讓光色更暖或更冷、更亮或更暗，或把頁面切換成夜間模式。保存喜歡的光色，一點就能切換回來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn't look like a book Evening Reader can open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這看起來不像是 Evening Reader 能打開的書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn't look like a book.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這看起來不像是一本書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That doesn't look like a web address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這看起來不像是網址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's a loan ticket, not a book.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是借閱憑證，不是書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's more than the on-device model can hold at once. Try a shorter passage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內容超過裝置上模型一次能處理的長度，請試試較短的段落。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The article lands in your library, ready to read — and it's kept on this device, so it's there even with no connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文章會出現在你的書庫中，隨時可讀。它保存在這部裝置上，即使沒有網路也能閱讀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The crease is the gutter. Swipe, or tap near either edge, to turn the page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摺痕就是書的中縫。滑動或點一下左右邊緣即可翻頁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file ends before it should.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案提前結束了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
