            "value": "光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS keeps its dictionaries per language, and downloads them on demand. If this looks like an ordinary word, the dictionary for it may not be on this device yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 會依語言分別保存字典，並在需要時才下載。如果這看起來是個普通字詞，可能是對應的字典尚未下載到這部裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS keeps the Reading List private to Safari, so it can't be imported directly. In Safari, open a saved page, tap Share, and choose **Save to Evening Reader** — the article lands in this library, stripped down and lit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 將閱讀列表限定在 Safari 內，因此無法直接匯入。請在 Safari 中打開已儲存的頁面，點一下「分享」並選擇 **儲存到 Evening Reader**，文章就會以精簡、溫暖的樣貌出現在這個書庫中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone Duo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
